cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TTI-Scope in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TTI-Scope: A 5G TTI-aware Nsys Visualisation Tool for Practical AI-RAN"
abstract: >-
  TTI-Scope visualises the CUDA kernel launch patterns of NVIDIA Aerial
  CUDA-Accelerated RAN on the DU's own SFN.slot grid, from Nsight Systems
  captures and Aerial logs, for co-located 5G and LLM inference (AI-RAN).
authors:
  - family-names: Mitra
    given-names: "R. N."
    affiliation: "Systems Research Group, University of Cambridge, UK"
repository-code: "https://github.com/srg-airan-cambridge/tti-scope"
url: "https://github.com/srg-airan-cambridge/tti-scope"
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-10-04"
keywords:
  - AI-RAN
  - 5G
  - NVIDIA Aerial
  - CUDA
  - Nsight Systems
  - GPU profiling
  - TTI
